{"root":{"data":{"id":"dfgewbr9qa00","created":1767591514642,"text":"Godot游戏开发学习笔记"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgex6rhwkw0","created":1767591582136,"text":"节点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgioiixmns0","created":1767602186902,"text":"游戏的由多种关系紧密的节点，以树状结构构建而成，节点与节点之间有继承和耦合的特性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfgis8qjchc0","created":1767602479050,"text":"继承"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgisk6g4m80","created":1767602503957,"text":"子节点继承父节点的特性、功能和属性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgjgbvpdqo0","created":1767604366633,"text":"构建场景的位置问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgjggt1ry80","created":1767604377356,"text":"1、确保根节点的位置在原点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfgjgqz6ef40","created":1767604399495,"text":"2、子节点的位置相对于父节点，父节点移动时会跟随移动。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dfgjhrn4dfc0","created":1767604479307,"text":"3、未实例化前，子节点的位置变化会影响在父节点中的对位置。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgisceqqs80","created":1767602487044,"text":"节点功能记录","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgilys26io0","created":1767601987190,"text":"Node2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi12fusjjs0","created":1767755618122,"text":"介绍","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgimag8ops0","created":1767602012596,"text":"2D 游戏对象，具有变换（位置、旋转、缩放）。包括物理对象和精灵在内的所有 2D 节点都继承自 Node2D。可以使用 Node2D 作为父节点来移动、缩放和旋转 2D 项目中的子节点。还可以控制该节点的渲染顺序。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgivys53c00","created":1767602770836,"text":"Sprite2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi12fusjjs0","created":1767755618122,"text":"介绍","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgixxj9i9s0","created":1767602924851,"text":"显示 2D 纹理的节点。显示的纹理可以是较大图集纹理中的某个区域，也可以是精灵表动画中的某一帧。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgj0jql29s0","created":1767603129911,"text":"Area2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi12fusjjs0","created":1767755618122,"text":"介绍","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgj0vbl9ko0","created":1767603155126,"text":"2D 空间中的一个区域，能够检测到其他 CollisionObject2D 的进入或退出。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfhzxptwdg00","created":1767752426905,"text":"TileMapLayer（瓦片地图集）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfhzzozxpp40","created":1767752581822,"text":"介绍"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfhzzrv2zs00","created":1767752588058,"text":"基于 2D 图块的地图节点。TileMapLayer 即图块地图层，需要使用包含了图块列表的 TileSet，用于创建基于栅格的地图。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfi005ivg6w0","created":1767752617795,"text":"功能和方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi028be7eo0","created":1767752780602,"text":"TileSet"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi02b4aqk80","created":1767752786703,"text":"图块列表即瓦片集"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfi03h6skao0","created":1767752878279,"text":"TileSize"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi03j280pc0","created":1767752882356,"text":"一个属性，基准瓦片的像素大小，16Px 16Px"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfhzxptwdg00","created":1767752426905,"text":"TileMapLayer（瓦片地图集）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfhzzozxpp40","created":1767752581822,"text":"介绍"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfhzzrv2zs00","created":1767752588058,"text":"专门用于通过脚本移动的角色的 2D 物理物体。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfi005ivg6w0","created":1767752617795,"text":"功能和方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi028be7eo0","created":1767752780602,"text":"TileSet"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi02b4aqk80","created":1767752786703,"text":"图块列表即瓦片集"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfi03h6skao0","created":1767752878279,"text":"TileSize"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi03j280pc0","created":1767752882356,"text":"一个属性，基准瓦片的像素大小，16Px 16Px"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfi13nngfk00","created":1767755713457,"text":"CollisionShape2D"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi13odfku80","created":1767755715027,"text":"介绍"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfi13oxhii80","created":1767755716240,"text":"通常用于创建碰撞区域，向 CollisionObject2D 父级提供 Shape2D 并允许对其进行编辑的节点。这可以为 Area2D 提供检测形状或将 PhysicsBody2D 转变为实体对象。"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgex78gl080","created":1767591583162,"text":"渲染和更新","layout_right_offset":{"x":-6.2499997206032845,"y":47.499997876584644}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkjyp5q000","created":1767607472506,"text":"方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkk1j25gg0","created":1767607478667,"text":"_Process(delta)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkkipwg0w0","created":1767607516086,"text":"通常用于非物理性的渲染和更新，比如标签，"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgkk1ugb7c0","created":1767607479356,"text":"_PhysicsProcess(delta)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgkkj1zj000","created":1767607516817,"text":"通常用于物理性的渲染和更新，比如碰撞，受击"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgklnyncvk0","created":1767607605863,"text":"_Ready()"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgklvdc6lc0","created":1767607621989,"text":"用于初始化节点参数，表示节准备就绪"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dfgpd64ymzc0","created":1767621045699,"text":" [Export] public float Speed = 200.0f; //速度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dfgpd87n6mo0","created":1767621050215,"text":"在节点外创建一个可以随时调整的属性"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"snow","version":"1.4.43"}